# iOS design system

Stack: **shadcn/ui** primitives in `ui/`, **Ct** composites for app patterns, **Tailwind v4** + CSS tokens.

## Theme tokens

Edit **`src/core/styles/tokens.css`** to retheme the app. Change `--palette-*` values; semantic tokens (`--primary`, `--background`, etc.) map into Tailwind automatically.

**Fonts** (self-hosted in `public/fonts/`):
- LTR locales → `--font-family-ltr` (system / iOS stack)
- RTL locales (`fa`, `ar`) → `--font-family-rtl` (**Vazirmatn** via `html[dir='rtl']`)

`@font-face` rules live in `src/core/styles/fonts.css`.

Programmatic reference: `src/core/configs/theme.ts`.

## Layers

| Layer | Path | Naming | Role |
|-------|------|--------|------|
| shadcn internals | `modules/app/components/ui/` | lowercase (`button.tsx`) | **Do not import in pages/features** — implementation only |
| Primitives | `modules/app/components/Ct*.tsx` | `CtButton`, `CtCard`, `CtInput`, … | Public UI API |
| Select parts | `CtSelectParts.tsx` | `CtSelectRoot`, `CtSelectTrigger`, … | Low-level select (form field uses `forms/CtSelect`) |
| Surfaces | `modules/app/components/surface/` | `CtSurface`, `CtGroup`, `CtListRow` | iOS grouped layouts |
| Widgets | `modules/app/components/widgets/` | `CtTable`, … | Composed patterns |
| Forms | `modules/app/components/forms/` | `CtTextInput`, `CtSelect`, … | react-hook-form fields |

Feature modules reuse app `Ct*` components — do not fork per module.

**Import rule:** pages, layouts, and feature code import `CtButton`, `CtCard`, etc. Never `Button` from `ui/`.

## iOS patterns

- **Background**: `bg-background` (grouped gray)
- **Elevated card**: `<Card variant="elevated">` or `ios-surface`
- **Grouped list**: `<CtGroup>` + rows or `<Card variant="grouped">`
- **Inset field block**: `<Card variant="inset">`
- **Buttons**: filled (`default`), gray (`secondary`), tinted (`tinted`), plain (`plain` / `ghost`)
- **Touch target**: default button height `h-11` (44px)
- **Radius**: `rounded-xl` / `rounded-2xl` via `--radius`

## Motion utilities (`global.css`)

- `ios-press` — subtle scale on tap
- `ios-fade-in` / `ios-slide-up` — light entrance
- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`

## RTL

Use logical utilities only (`ms-*`, `text-start`, `ps-*`). See `rtl-logical-css.mdc`.

## Tables

Use `CtTable` + `CtTableHeader` / `CtTableBody` / `CtTableRow` / `CtTableCell` from `widgets/table/CtTable.tsx`. Renders inside an iOS grouped surface by default.

## Adding shadcn components

```bash
bunx shadcn@latest add <component> -y
```

Then apply iOS styling: `rounded-xl`, `bg-input`, `shadow-ios-sm`, `ios-press` where appropriate.
